 $4.$ The maximum output is $5$ (at $t=-4$), and the minimum output is $-3$ (at $t=0$). \n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{max}_{t\\in T}h(t) & =5 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{t\\in T}h(t) & =-4 \\\\ {min}_{t\\in T}h(t) & =-3 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{t\\in T}h(t) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-5add7f78-978a-512e-aef3-6c382ab2be06" "answer-field-1e00f5be-3d45-51a7-8749-7d495f6cdca7" "answer-field-33caca9d-1372-58e9-a4ff-a1e38fc0dee1" "answer-field-f2f7a01d-04e9-5668-a3bc-13c57aa6f398"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5add7f78-978a-512e-aef3-6c382ab2be06" :answer-field/id #uuid "5add7f78-978a-512e-aef3-6c382ab2be06" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-66c7e82e-c220-5e51-a89e-ba9b54a5c39a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-66c7e82e-c220-5e51-a89e-ba9b54a5c39a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-66c7e82e-c220-5e51-a89e-ba9b54a5c39a" :answer/id #uuid "66c7e82e-c220-5e51-a89e-ba9b54a5c39a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1e00f5be-3d45-51a7-8749-7d495f6cdca7" :answer-field/id #uuid "1e00f5be-3d45-51a7-8749-7d495f6cdca7" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-661a1e03-e2d2-5276-a436-6f6a23ebdbeb" :answer-field/choices ["answer-661a1e03-e2d2-5276-a436-6f6a23ebdbeb"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-661a1e03-e2d2-5276-a436-6f6a23ebdbeb" :answer/id #uuid "661a1e03-e2d2-5276-a436-6f6a23ebdbeb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-33caca9d-1372-58e9-a4ff-a1e38fc0dee1" :answer-field/id #uuid "33caca9d-1372-58e9-a4ff-a1e38fc0dee1" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-0dd02e9a-a088-5f88