$ |\n| $5$ | $4$ |\n\nThe table above gives values of a function $h$ on the set $T=\\{-4,-2,0,3,5\\}.$ Compute the following:\n\n${max}_{t\\in T}h(t)=$\n{{field-1}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{t\\in T}h(t)=$\n{{field-2}}\n\n${min}_{t\\in T}h(t)=$\n{{field-3}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{t\\in T}h(t)=$\n{{field-4}}"] ["question-8d772d0d-c3c0-582b-9807-e2b516a97226" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the maximum output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that maximum output occurs.\n\nOn the other hand,\n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the minimum output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that minimum output occurs.\n\nThe output values are $5,-1,-3,2,$ and $4.$ The maximum output is $5$ (at $t=-4$), and the minimum output is $-3$ (at $t=0$). \n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{max}_{t\\in T}h(t) & =5 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{t\\in T}h(t) & =-4 \\\\ {min}_{t\\in T}h(t) & =-3 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{t\\in T}h(t) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-8d772d0d-c3c0-582b-9807-e2b516a97226" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-5add7f78-978a-512e-aef3-6c382ab2be06" :answer-field/id #uuid "5add7f78-978a-512e-aef3-6c382ab2be06"] ["answer-66c7e82e-c220-5e51-a89e-ba9b54a5c39a" :answer/id #uuid "66c7e82e-c220-5e51-a89e-ba9b54a5c39a"] ["answer-66c7e82e-c220-5e51-a89e-ba9b54a5c39a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-66c7e82e-c220-5e51-a89e-ba9b54a5c39a" :answer/value "5"] ["answer-field-5add7f78-978a-512e-aef3-6c382ab2be06" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-5add7f78-978a-512e-aef3-6c382ab2be06" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-5add7f78-978a-512e-aef3-6c382ab2be06" :answer-field/correct "answer-66c7e82e-c220-5e51-a89e-ba9b54a5c39a"] ["answer-field-5add7f78-978a-512e-aef3-6c382ab2be06" :answer-field/choices "answer-66c7e82e-c220-5e51-a89e-ba9