{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that minimum output occurs.\n\nThe output values are $-2,1,-1,$ and $5.$ The maximum output is $5$ (at $t=3$), and the minimum output is $-2$ (at $t=-4$). \n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{max}_{t\\in T}g(t) & =5 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{t\\in T}g(t) & =3 \\\\ {min}_{t\\in T}g(t) & =-2 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{t\\in T}g(t) & =-4\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-3ad87e41-53b3-5b37-8281-b66e69b1893c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-30f75949-1681-58fb-8caf-2218bd6afb9b" :answer-field/id #uuid "30f75949-1681-58fb-8caf-2218bd6afb9b"] ["answer-849ba614-84c6-5cbd-bf6b-0dc3d10bccfd" :answer/id #uuid "849ba614-84c6-5cbd-bf6b-0dc3d10bccfd"] ["answer-849ba614-84c6-5cbd-bf6b-0dc3d10bccfd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-849ba614-84c6-5cbd-bf6b-0dc3d10bccfd" :answer/value "5"] ["answer-field-30f75949-1681-58fb-8caf-2218bd6afb9b" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-30f75949-1681-58fb-8caf-2218bd6afb9b" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-30f75949-1681-58fb-8caf-2218bd6afb9b" :answer-field/correct "answer-849ba614-84c6-5cbd-bf6b-0dc3d10bccfd"] ["answer-field-30f75949-1681-58fb-8caf-2218bd6afb9b" :answer-field/choices "answer-849ba614-84c6-5cbd-bf6b-0dc3d10bccfd"] ["answer-field-dfcf5b8a-03c8-5eef-a18c-d9d86c1f1ea8" :answer-field/id #uuid "dfcf5b8a-03c8-5eef-a18c-d9d86c1f1ea8"] ["answer-9c65f68b-6e7a-56bc-977c-fbf1148d3cd6" :answer/id #uuid "9c65f68b-6e7a-56bc-977c-fbf1148d3cd6"] ["answer-9c65f68b-6e7a-56bc-977c-fbf1148d3cd6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-9c65f68b-6e7a-56bc-977c-fbf1148d3cd6" :answer/value "3"] ["answer-field-dfcf5b8a-03c8-5eef-a18c-d9d86c1f1ea8" :answer-field/key "field-2"] ["answer-field-dfcf5b8a-03c8-5eef-a18c-d9d86c1f1ea8" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-dfcf5b8a-03c8-5eef-a18c-d9d86c1f1ea8" :answer-field/correct "answer-9c65f68b-6e7a-56bc-977c-fbf1148d3cd6"] ["answer