ue of $h(x)$ for each $x\\in T.$ Assuming that all the dots have integer coordinates, compute the following:\n\n${max}_{x\\in T}h(x)=$\n{{field-1}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in T}h(x)=$\n{{field-2}}\n\n${min}_{x\\in T}h(x)=$\n{{field-3}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in T}h(x)=$\n{{field-4}}"] ["question-79c3ad8c-6f33-5a09-8a92-570cf7bc908c" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the maximum output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that maximum output occurs.\n\nOn the other hand,\n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the minimum output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that minimum output occurs.\n\nFrom the graph, \n\n- the highest point is at $(2,3),$ so ${max}_{x\\in T}h(x)=3$ and $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in T}h(x)=2,$ and\n\n- the lowest point is at $(0,-3),$ so ${min}_{x\\in T}h(x)=-3$ and $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in T}h(x)=0.$"] ["question-79c3ad8c-6f33-5a09-8a92-570cf7bc908c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-0aad743d-8ba5-5337-80cb-c78474745b6a" :answer-field/id #uuid "0aad743d-8ba5-5337-80cb-c78474745b6a"] ["answer-4aedb0ca-c06b-5df2-b475-a620f0810e2e" :answer/id #uuid "4aedb0ca-c06b-5df2-b475-a620f0810e2e"] ["answer-4aedb0ca-c06b-5df2-b475-a620f0810e2e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4aedb0ca-c06b-5df2-b475-a620f0810e2e" :answer/value "3"] ["answer-field-0aad743d-8ba5-5337-80cb-c78474745b6a" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-0aad743d-8ba5-5337-80cb-c78474745b6a" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-0aad743d-8ba5-5337-80cb-c78474745b6a" :answer-field/correct "answer-4aedb0ca-c06b-5df2-b475-a620f0810e2e"] ["answer-field-0aad743d-8ba5-5337-80cb-c78474745b6a" :answer-field/choices "answer-4aedb0ca-c06b-5df2-b475-a620f0810e2e"] ["answer-field-f483d2df-b9cf-50d1-a630-f22f82aee20c" :answer-field/id #uuid "f483d2df-b9cf-50d1-a630-f22f82aee20c"] ["answer-8b240ae8-8138-51da-9cc2-e69a75cf9aed" :answer/id #uuid "8b240ae8-8138-51da-9cc2-e69a75cf9aed"] ["answer-8b240ae8-8138-51da-9cc2-e69a75cf9aed" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-8b240ae8-8138-51da-9cc2-e69a75cf9aed" :answer/value "2"] ["answer-field-f483d2df-b9cf-50d1-a630-f22f82aee20c" :answer-field/key "field-2"] ["answer-field-f483d2df-b9cf-50d1-a630-f22f82aee20c" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-f483d2df-b9cf-50d1-a630-f22f82aee20c" :answer-field/correct "answer-8b240ae8-8138-51da-9cc2-e69a75cf9aed"] ["answer-field-f483d2df-b9cf-50d1-a630-f22f82aee20c" :answer-field/choices "answer-8b240ae8-8138-51da-9cc2-e69a75cf9aed"] ["answer-field-d02bb7c5-371d-5577-8733-d6381c78836f" :answer-field/id #uuid "d02bb7c5-371d-5577-8733-d6381c78836f"] ["answer-11ddc8d5-5d4c-5727-9340-5fb584443922" :answer/id #uuid "11ddc8d5-5d4c-5727-9340-5fb584443922"] ["answer-11ddc8d5-5d4c-5727-9340-5fb584443922" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-11ddc8d5-5d4c-5727-9340-5fb584443922" :answer/value "-3"] ["answer-field-d02bb7c5-371d-5577-8733-d6381c78836f" :answer-field/key "field-3"] ["answer-field-d02bb7c5-371d-5577-8733-d6381c78836f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-d02bb7c5-371d-5577-8733-d6381c78836f" :answer-field/correct "answer-11ddc8d5-5d4c-5727-9340-5fb584443922"] ["answer-field-d02bb7c5-371d-5577-8733-d6381c78836f" :answer-field/choices "answer-11ddc8d5-5d4c-5727-9340-5fb584443922"] ["answer-field-8d978aec-9e8e-54a6-b0e9-0ee9ab40c5a2" :answer-field/id #uuid "8d978aec-9e8e-54a6-b0e9-0ee9ab40c5a2"] ["answer-5604273f-61c9-5658-af9a-25913ed5435c" :answer/id #uuid "5604273f-61c9-5658-af9a-25913ed5435c"] ["answer-5604273f-61c9-5658-af9a-25913ed5435c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-5604273f-61c9-5658-af9a-25913ed5435c" :answer/value "0"] ["answer-field-8d978aec-9e8e-54a6-b0e9-0ee9ab40c5a2" :answer-field/key "field-4"] ["answer-field-8d978aec-9e8e-54a6-b0e9-0ee9ab40c5a2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-8d978aec-9e8e-54a6-b0e9-0ee9ab40c5a2" :answer-field/correct "answer-5604273f-61c9-5658-af9a-25913ed5435c"] ["answer-field-8d978aec-9e8e-54a6-b0e9-0ee9ab40c5a2" :answer-field/choices "answer-5604273f-61c9-5658-af9a-25913ed5435c"] ["question-79c3ad8c-6f33-5a09-8a92-570cf7bc908c" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-0aad743d-8ba5-5337-80cb-c78474745b6a"] ["question-79c3ad8c-6f33-5a09-8a92-570cf7bc908c" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-f483d2df-b9cf-50d1-a630-f22f82aee20c"] ["question-79c3ad8c-6f33-5a09-8a92-570cf7bc908c" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-d02bb7c5-371d-5577-8733-d6381c78836f"] ["question-79c3ad8c-6f33-5a09-8a92-570cf7bc908c" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-8d978aec-9e8e-54a6-b0e9-0ee9ab40c5a2"] [17592186231454 :knowledge-point/questions "question-79c3ad8c-6f33-5a09-8a92-570cf7bc908c"] ["question-dc43d95b-1383-587c-8ba1-6694a0612d5c" :question/id #uuid "dc43d95b-1383-587c-8ba1-6694a0612d5c"] ["question-dc43d95b-1383-587c-8ba1-6694a0612d5c" :question/math-academy-id "q-355242"] ["question-dc43d95b-1383-587c-8ba1-6694a0612d5c" :question/problem "![](images/ab/ab745b7220264fbf24032104e9ae60d4ffe0b7a58ce1d9a88d1d16ab4c23f9cc.png)\n\nLet $T=\\{-2,-1,0,1\\}.$ The graph above shows the value of $g(x)$ for each $x\\in T.$ Assuming that all the dots have integer coordinates, compute the following:\n\n${max}_{x\\in T}g(x)=$\n{{field-1}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in T}g(x)=$\n{{field-2}}\n\n${min}_{x\\in T}g(x)=$\n{{field-3}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in T}g(x)=$\n{{field-4}}"] ["question-dc43d95b-1383-587c-8ba1-6694a0612d5c" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the maximum output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that maximum output occurs.\n\nOn the other hand,\n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the minimum output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that minimum output occurs.\n\nFrom the graph, \n\n- the highest point is at $(-1,5),$ so ${max}_{x\\in T}g(x)=5$ and $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in T}g(x)=-1,$ and\n\n- the lowest point is at $(0,1),$ so ${min}_{x\\in T}g(x)=1$ and $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in T}g(x)=0.$"] ["question-dc43d95b-1383-587c-8ba1-6694a0612d5c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-39c90585-147b-5591-bf04-75354a334afb" :answer-field/id #uuid "39c90585-147b-5591-bf04-75354a334afb"] ["answer-60eecf3d-93cd-5625-9da7-3d5ee2a20543" :answer/id #uuid "60eecf3d-93cd-5625-9da7-3d5ee2a20543"] ["answer-60eecf3d-93cd-5625-9da7-3d5ee2a20543" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-60eecf3d-93cd-5625-9da7-3d5ee2a20543" :answer/value "5"] ["answer-field-39c90585-147b-5591-bf04-75354a334afb" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-39c90585-147b-5591-bf04-75354a334afb" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-39c90585-147b-5591-bf04-75354a334afb" :answer-field/correct "answer-60eecf3d-93cd-5625-9da7-3d5ee2a20543"] ["answer-field-39c90585-147b-5591-bf04-75354a334afb" :answer-field/choices "answer-60eecf3d-93cd-5625-9da7-3d5ee2a20543"] ["answer-field-3790112f-9ad3-5b4b-ac19-1ba1cf54ede5" :answer-field/id #uuid "3790112f-9ad3-5b4b-ac19-1ba1cf54ede5"] ["answer-dfa59b1b-8788-5026-b7df-30dea62754a3" :answer/id #uuid "dfa59b1b-8788-5026-b7df-30dea62754a3"] ["answer-dfa59b1b-8788-5026-b7df-30dea62754a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-dfa59b1b-8788-5026-b7df-30dea62754a3" :answer/value "-1"] ["answer-field-3790112f-9ad3-5b4b-ac19-1ba1cf54ede5" :answer-field/key "field-2"] ["answer-field-3790112f-9ad3-5b4b-ac19-1ba1cf54ede5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-3790112f-9ad3-5b4b-ac19-1ba1cf54ede5" :answer-field/correct "answer-dfa59b1b-8788-5026-b7df-30dea62754a3"] ["answer-field-3790112f-9ad3-5b4b-ac19-1ba1cf54ede5" :answer-field/choices "answer-dfa59b1b-8788-5026-b7df-30dea62754a3"] ["answer-field-e98936a7-13b6-520c-9990-bd1d84f1027a" :answer-field/id #uuid 